    title: "SCIP arm labels every occurrence edge 'references'; the 92 edges shared with tree-sitter are 'calls' there, so edge_key never sees a duplicate (ADR-0057 prerequisite)"  # df67
    status: todo_hard  # df67
    priority: 2  # df67
